From: r36llm maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] qwen35: optional CPU PTQ1_0 restricted output rows

LLAMA_OUTPUT_KEEP selects sorted original token ids for the output head only.
Reuse the normal Hadamard input transform, Q8_0 activation quantizer, and
PTQ1_0 dot kernel, leaving the tied embedding and tokenizer untouched.
Missing ids have -inf logits. The unset/empty environment variable retains
the existing graph.

Base: PrismML-Eng/llama.cpp 5628c7338963b00a598f2a588fd09a79af6d70db + 0001 + 0002
Apply after 0001-arm-neon-armv8.0-bonsai-dot.patch and
0002-arm-neon-bonsai-two-rows.patch; it also applies independently after 0001.
Upstream-Status: Not submitted [experimental English/French output restriction]

